    "turn_text": "a five year old too. So maybe maybe we agree. But generally I do think it's a good thing for as a communications platform. But you brought up a set as you have a bill and it's part of a larger effort by house Republicans to to do section 230 reform yours actually though deals with product liability which I hadn't even thought of but I suppose if you have like a like a like a service like Amazon where third parties are allowed to sell their products through Amazon what liability does Amazon have to make sure that the battery that I'm buying through there isn't going to blow up when I receive it That's a very interesting question and a part of section 230 because I've always thought of it from the political speech perspective, right? Because that's what I deal with the most. I hadn't thought of that. Tell us about your bill.",
